<title>USA: US banks free rsrv $363 mln/day April 23 rvd 2 wks.</title>
<headline>US banks free rsrv $363 mln/day April 23 rvd 2 wks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. commercial banks had revised free reserves of $363 million per day in the two weeks ended April 23, versus revised free reserves of $876 million in the previous two-week period, the Federal Reserve said.</p>
<p>Seasonal borrowings were $86 million versus $61 million a day. Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
